From 5bcd16ccd55fa06eca29b714b6ac1c948187a882 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincenzo Grimaldi <vincenzo@igrimaldi.engineering>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 13:49:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: capability register, work registry, command palette,
 mega menu

Adds app/lib/registry.ts as the single source of truth for capabilities and
shipped work. Every capability names the employer, thesis or public repository
where it was exercised; entries without provenance are not admitted. Selecting
a domain filters the work registry beneath it.

Navigation, adapted from the three references:
  AWS    - labelled 'Work' mega menu generated from the registry
  Square - Cmd/Ctrl+K palette, subsequence matching, full keyboard control
  Tesla  - hairline reading-progress rail

React and CSS only. package.json is unchanged: no next-themes, no
framer-motion, no cmdk, no shadcn.
